RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, January to February is the driest pair on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, and it came in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 35% of normal in January to February and 58% of normal in September to October. So far in 2026, March to April ran 221% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 27466 had its driest year in 1963 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
